  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-catalog\" style=\"background: repeat rgb(255, 255, 255); color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 20px;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEisDM-b72A61xhr3EkY4o_tmgC3conV0QM2Jk10ElQOe1AnJE_kCDbrZ7ihaOL1w3c-m6dCPunS7M3DrCigESZt0T6paIHA-xr0qdJU4CqqPncUNrRapxxtJRO_T2gP8pkuGAYSrKbrzU6VZ4T4_HZFU5oAdhoSguEGG9sbsFu5AplUskz23CDMSNM-YI5V\" style=\"box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 10px 30px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">BONG報第 388 期 • 目錄</h2>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post.html\">封面圖</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/e.html\">編輯室ê話</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">《台文通訊》前總編輯葉國基記念特集</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">34</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/siau.html\">Siàu念葉國基先生</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張秀滿</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">36</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_826.html\">懷念葉國基兄</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 蘇正玄</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">做伙來唸詩</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">1</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/37e.html\">37度半ê運動埕</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張菊芸</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_03.html\">啄樹鳥</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳秀枝</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">4</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_592.html\">水淹到跤頭趺去</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 呂莛鈺</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">32</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/m-thang-hau.html\">柚仔，m̄-thang háu</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ ogo</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">新聞稿</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">6</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_185.html\">監察院認定國語政策是錯誤<br />民團呼籲啟動語言正義工程</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 語言轉型正義聯盟</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">8</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_93.html\">狗蟻</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 藍春瑞</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">生活ê藝術</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">10</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/e-e.html\">種綠竹筍ê穡頭</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 黃子育</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">12</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/e-e_01417223691.html\">路邊ê埔姜仔栽</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 賴羿均</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語sa攏有</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">14</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/sa-ehuah.html\">無耳ê茶鈷，按怎huah燒？</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／吳品瑜<br />記錄／黃安碩</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Lán來講看māi</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">18</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/lanmai-koh-khah.html\">大水真艱苦，無水koh-khah苦</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳春美</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">20</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/lanmai-let-me-speak-like-taiwanese.html\">Let me speak like a Taiwanese!</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 薛翰駿</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">23</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/lanmai-euie-guarani-e.html\">變做官方語言ê族語：<br />Uì巴拉圭 ê Guaraní思考台語ê未來</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳韻如</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/lanmai-san-po-bih-jit-thau-chham-koane.html\">Sàn-pō͘ Bih Ji̍t-thâu, Chham-koan<br />高雄《台文通訊》展覽ê Kám-sióng</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ Júi-hûn</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">心內話</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">28</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_63.html\">非洲夜未眠</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 蔡苾瑋</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">30</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/blog-post_431.html\">總舖師換人做</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 王雅玲</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Sann-kap讀小說</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">40</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/08/sann-kap-ka-choah.html\">Ka-choa̍h人（四）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 杜信龍</div>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgoxCxju13yLm91AqqkcewyIZ5D919X7K7wHLXuhSsjEbQm-j7bmslYO19lEPESMqyt-HEcIg0veBhep5sayBGj7lx-mlrMoekw-anMwZNO0apGIyeR-rWP8bs4DryuHh35uxS8cJmCrJuC9oJON_PuMrlFznGUC1LC4jrgqlBLzWfgaLulLAIyHm9dCKGg\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEixu8_nybRE9beGtmFJep8dchEbw0KBYlXEmxGl_9teyIM-_puh7T8c4ZAFmOtgirhZcoRTOl91BePGc4jCqf440SPBmDd7LNBKSiqFpVuk3uko5OnSyRcHMzAwrIW5aT3r2R5g6G8b0uQ07fqS0GPYqpBPKT9Sk4IvPvzhiPN6gzsMPb6PfQiAuE2vyOIa\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjNiVwx6-77-SDULgj3q_bfHrUo3_Roo6-fMTHVqrNFfDeL-o1vio8JNE9ttAr4juuoLBCoqWQ6-5qs_iB9pGdVTb4Fx16bMNui_feJU0V7T55gpISpW383Hs1sXfZ08leSSo0pL1xgP9W9oImlsdNIowsKpQE18TyjKLQL8Z02EqrK7mCeBuIDefeAxh60\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 388期，2026年07月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
